      "writtenOn": "2024-05-01T23:51:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It has moved to `./include/linux/platform_data/cros_ec_commands.h`.\nThe script is also useful for other code base where we want a properly formatted `ec_commands.h` (coreboot).\nHaving said that, kernel maintainers do not like cosmetic fixes, so change to the kernel include file is only done when a new feature described in `ec_commands.h` is actually added (via a driver) into the kernel.",
      "parentUuid": "fc0eee56_c2062fd2",
      "revId": "50c337c38e58316b7117a3912206ab1e03771b11",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
