      "writtenOn": "2024-05-01T22:53:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "util/make_linux_ec_commands_h.sh uses unifdef, which doesn\u0027t exist on glinux machines, but is in the chroot.\n\nThis is still better than what we have now, which just errors and makes you manually run it.",
      "parentUuid": "f2e8d814_3ce6c030",
